Mon Oct 26 11:12:05 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.13.0 (upstream tag v0.13.0, 2026-10-25):
  * PDF plotting now uses craft-pdf's krilla writer
  * Panels use craft-ui's shared docking
  * New: RECTANG Center Rectangle mode, MEASUREINIT, usage
    cross-reference, appload from a path or file picker, implied
    closed loops from loose LINE and ARC chains, CLI {last} handle
  * DXF/DWG: layout kept on save, DIMASSOC for angular, diametric
    and radial dimensions, proxy objects keep their class, drawing
    variable dictionary written, arrowhead block names kept
  * Many fixes: dimension text placement (DIMTMOVE, DIMTAD), HATCH
    with multiline islands, STRETCH multilines, SVG arc flags and
    viewBox sizing, AutoLISP getangle/angtof/getkword/entmake,
    surveyor angles, QuickCalc shortcut, Italian, Portuguese,
    Swedish and Chinese translations
  * Cargo dependency group bump (17 crates); docs on security
    limits; autosave folder owner-only on Unix
  * No CVE keywords in the release notes; cargo_vendor audit clean
    ("All lockfiles are audited", no RUSTSEC advisories).
- Re-vendored at upstream's locked versions (update=false kept):
  new crates craft-pdf (craft-libs git dep, MIT OR Apache-2.0),
  krilla 0.8.2, pdf-writer 0.15.0 and subsetter 0.2.6 (all
  MIT OR Apache-2.0); vendor-tree licence set and License tag
  unchanged; no new system deps; cargo floor 1.95 still
- Set the fixed metainfo release date to 2026-10-25 (v0.13.0)
- Legal-Review-Notice: acadrust is now 0.6.5 (locked version)

