Sun Oct 18 17:25:40 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.8.0 (upstream tag v0.8.0, 2026-10-17):
  * RECTANG keeps its area when ortho would move the other corner
  * Harden the control port: a non-request first line gets one
    error reply and closes; idle/write timeouts; at most 64
    queued requests (no CVE assigned)
  * Xrefs and table data links follow stored paths only on this
    computer or the drawing's share, via craft-docpath
  * No CVE keywords in the 0.7.0-0.8.0 range; cargo_audit clean.
- Vendor-tree licence set unchanged; two rev-pinned craft-libs
  deps now (craft-ui for the UI, craft-docpath for path
  resolution), both MIT OR Apache-2.0 and vendored.

