Tue Oct 13 07:34:57 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.6.2 (upstream tag v0.6.2, 2026-10-12).
  Commands and entities: GROUP family, MLINE/MLSTYLE, HELIX, REGION
  booleans, TOLERANCE frames, tables with formulas, Xrefs, SELECTSIMILAR
  and isolation, OVERKILL, MATCHPROP, DATAEXTRACTION, QDIM, the DIMEDIT
  family, SCRIPT files, drawing COMPARE, QuickCalc, and an OPTIONS dialog
  with surviving user profiles; AUDIT/RECOVER plus crash autosave/recovery.
  Interchange: DXF/DWG save at version 2000-2018 and binary DXF, native
  MULTILEADER, pre-2007 DWGCODEPAGE files, SVG/SVGZ import, PDF layers and
  embedded-text subsets. Plot styles (CTB monochrome/grayscale, STB named),
  PLOTSTYLE, a Plot dialog with preview, and plotter device configs. Text:
  RTL/bidi with Arabic shaping and new interface languages
  (pt-BR, de, es, cs, ru, fr, pt, zh). Rendering: fatal wgpu buffer-overflow
  fix, GPU device-loss handling with immediate autosave, GPU previews.
  Control server bounds request lines and connections.
  No CVE keywords in the 0.5.0-0.6.2 range; cargo_audit clean.
- Packaging: cargo floor 1.90 to 1.95 (cadcraft-ui-egui and craft-ui declare
  rust-version 1.95); one rev-pinned git crate (craft-ui, MIT OR Apache-2.0)
  vendored with the rest at upstream's locked versions (update=false:
  acadrust 0.6.4 fails 3 DWG roundtrip tests). License tag unchanged
  (290 crates re-derived); no new system deps.

