Sun Oct 11 19:17:09 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- New package cadcraft 0.5.0 (upstream tag v0.5.0, 2026-10-11):
  open-source CAD/drafting with command line, snaps, layers,
  dimensions, hatches and blocks; DXF/DWG open and save, SVG/PNG
  export, MCP command server in the cadcraft-cli subpackage.
- DXF round-trip fidelity: layer transparency and description, frozen
  viewport layers, LWPOLYLINE elevation, dimension text rotation,
  arc-length dimensions, non-ASCII text as \U+ escapes.
- DWG reads go through the acadrust crate (MPL-2.0, see the
  Legal-Review-Notice); runaway conversions stop early at a named limit.
- Commands: EXPLODE keeps elevations, JOIN, HATCHEDIT gradient reset,
  deferred LINE tangents, SCALE Reference option, PLINE halfwidth
  semantics; dirty-close asks Save / Don't Save / Cancel.
- Interface: Light and System themes, command history (F2), ViewCube
  and UCS icon, per-character font fallback with CJK support.
- Vendored with cargo_vendor update=true (no vendor/ shipped upstream;
  validator warning accepted with precedent): license tag re-derived
  over the shipped-target vendor tree.

